{"2647960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "GrindFest", "steam_appid": 2647960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Code your way to glory</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control your heroes using the <strong>C#</strong> programming language, and unleash them into a massive <strong>seamless</strong> world. Your bots will <strong>hack and slash</strong> their way through hordes of Orks, level up, craft weapons for the Dwarfs, disregard Elves, acquire gold, brew <strong><i>colorful</i></strong> mushrooms and gaze into the Abyss. All this while you can sit back, <i>relax</i>, fine-tune your code and admire your bots' progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This game is made for you</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Be a <i>Hero.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the ancient art of C#.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Loot, loot, <strong>loot</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Play as any of the archetypical classes including healer, tank, and damage dealer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Let the game play itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore Gothic Horror world inspired by the classics of High Fantasy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Kill everyone.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Code your way to glory</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control your heroes using the <strong>C#</strong> programming language, and unleash them into a massive <strong>seamless</strong> world. Your bots will <strong>hack and slash</strong> their way through hordes of Orks, level up, craft weapons for the Dwarfs, disregard Elves, acquire gold, brew <strong><i>colorful</i></s